1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:01,650
Remember Spirit Power?

2
00:00:01,970 --> 00:00:05,640
You choose one of the two top Spirit cards, and do what it says.

3
00:00:05,960 --> 00:00:07,218
Here are all six.

4
00:00:08,233 --> 00:00:09,214
Here they are.

5
00:00:09,534 --> 00:00:11,369
Let's look at them one at a time.

6
00:00:12,199 --> 00:00:13,096
The Bear.

7
00:00:13,415 --> 00:00:15,805
Put every stone from the bowl back in the bag.

8
00:00:16,125 --> 00:00:18,301
Then draw the same number of new ones.

9
00:00:18,621 --> 00:00:19,709
Then take one.

10
00:00:20,029 --> 00:00:22,290
Use it when the bowl has nothing you need.

11
00:00:23,399 --> 00:00:24,295
The Wolf.

12
00:00:24,615 --> 00:00:26,514
Draw four stones into the bowl.

13
00:00:26,834 --> 00:00:27,922
Then take one.

14
00:00:28,242 --> 00:00:29,437
Lots of choice!

15
00:00:30,566 --> 00:00:31,462
The Ram.

16
00:00:31,782 --> 00:00:34,427
Draw two stones from the bag, without looking.

17
00:00:34,747 --> 00:00:37,009
Put them straight on your board, if they fit.

18
00:00:37,329 --> 00:00:39,654
A stone that doesn't fit goes in the bowl.

19
00:00:39,974 --> 00:00:41,190
It's a surprise!

20
00:00:42,300 --> 00:00:43,217
The Eagle.

21
00:00:43,537 --> 00:00:44,732
Take one stone.

22
00:00:45,052 --> 00:00:47,185
Your cards turn face-up as usual.

23
00:00:47,505 --> 00:00:49,318
Then you play another whole turn!

24
00:00:50,433 --> 00:00:51,244
The Deer.

25
00:00:51,564 --> 00:00:54,017
Move one of your own stones back to the bowl.

26
00:00:54,337 --> 00:00:55,468
Then take two.

27
00:00:55,788 --> 00:00:57,452
Good for fixing a mistake.

28
00:00:58,566 --> 00:00:59,590
The Bison.

29
00:00:59,910 --> 00:01:02,577
Draw three stones into the bowl, and take one.

30
00:01:02,897 --> 00:01:05,414
Then put one stone from the bowl back in the bag.

31
00:01:05,734 --> 00:01:07,548
It can even be a Spirit Stone.

32
00:01:07,868 --> 00:01:09,702
That makes the game last longer.

33
00:01:10,833 --> 00:01:13,393
Always do the steps in the order they are written.

34
00:01:13,713 --> 00:01:16,337
Then put the Spirit card at the bottom of its pile.

35
00:01:17,466 --> 00:01:18,362
Remember.

36
00:01:18,682 --> 00:01:20,901
Choose one of the two top Spirit cards.

37
00:01:21,221 --> 00:01:22,650
Do its steps in order.

38
00:01:22,970 --> 00:01:26,704
Then the card goes under its pile, and your cards turn face-up.

39
00:01:27,024 --> 00:01:28,837
Next: watch a whole game.
